# Program shell-escape produces canonical posix shell syntax
# compatible with: bash/dash, zsh, ksh

>> c := Dastur shell-escape: ['abc'].
Chiqish yozish: c, yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: ( Dastur tizim: ['echo '] + c ), yangi-qator.

c := Dastur shell-escape: ['a'b'c'].
Chiqish yozish: c, yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: ( Dastur tizim: ['echo '] + c ), yangi-qator.

c := Dastur shell-escape: ['a\'c'].
Chiqish yozish: c, yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: ( Dastur tizim: ['echo '] + c ), yangi-qator.